			<div class="content" id="post-content-2093902">
									

<p>This is really good, though maybe a little similar to my <a href="/scp-1932">SCP-1932</a> in that it is playground equipment that gives you hallucinations of height and weird scary stuff but maybe they're not hallucinations and they're real for the person experiencing them, but that doesn't actually bother me at all - I can tell it's not copied.</p>
<p>I do think maybe making it be quite so lethal is a step too far, and I think personally I would have preferred it without the weird other reality that people experience (that is, if it just made you think you'd gone up in the air), but that's not to say that it's not interesting and well-written.</p>

